{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From planting seeds to sewing stylish outfits, every day is a mix of creativity and farming fun. Run your atelier, make unique outfits using sewing patterns, and dress up customers based on their requests. Customize your character, try out different styles, and bring your fashion dreams to life. It\u2019s time to grow your way to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/2a176174b7fa045b95d253e3f3321b7a.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/2a176174b7fa045b95d253e3f3321b7a.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/7ca9620fe3ffbe95eac59e2f600f711a.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend\u2019s unexpected offer of a new life in Cottonville might be just what you need. Far from the noise of Friglight, a small family sewing shop is waiting for you in this peaceful town. Cottonville offers a cozy escape where you can start fresh and build your career, one stitch at a time, while letting the drama of the big city fade away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/7ed2d1717300606693bb6f31a7714486.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/7ed2d1717300606693bb6f31a7714486.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/07679956f2f879f3d4ca99d75a1756fd.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character truly yours! Choose hairstyles, eyes, skin, and more alongside the outfits that match your style. As you progress, unlock new fashion items and expand your wardrobe to reflect your journey in Cottonville.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/6ea21c0ae87282a9a37a941a88663e21.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/6ea21c0ae87282a9a37a941a88663e21.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/bb9336189bf72430b181be69c13bfe33.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re growing crops or crafting trendy outfits, Cottonville combines the simple joys of farm life with the excitement of fashion design. You\u2019ll learn everything from fabric-making to fashion styling \u2013 right from the farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/a8dd650210b9df93011a77bf841734ef.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/a8dd650210b9df93011a77bf841734ef.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/01edae0915475a4040bf5662cfae1368.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and harvest essential crops like <strong>cotton, linen, and bamboo</strong>, and gather flowers for natural dyes to produce fabrics \u2013 all available in <strong>seven different colors</strong>. Buy new sewing patterns to expand your dress-up options and make even more fashionable clothes. Your farm provides everything needed to craft stylish outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/f4762298901784f09980bff9a6951e20.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/f4762298901784f09980bff9a6951e20.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your atelier is the heart of Cottonville\u2019s fashion world! With <strong>over 60 clothing designs</strong> and multiple color variations, you can sew, dye, and customize garments using a set collection of sewing patterns to match your customers' needs. Listen to their requests, mix and match fabrics, and create outfits that suit their personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/8f8c65927793b5e2868c52f8808242cc.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/8f8c65927793b5e2868c52f8808242cc.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/fb77b7b00c1325c8ff998b0a64c5bf30.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer has a story, and your designs help them shine. Whether it\u2019s a fancy dress for a festival, a warm sweater for winter, or a breezy outfit for summer, your boutique becomes the town\u2019s go-to fashion hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/2c38f3bff498226db2e2e6cdb44f0aa7.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/2c38f3bff498226db2e2e6cdb44f0aa7.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/cbf6e806badfcebf029b12dd385ff4fb.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 patterns with different color options to collect (Over 120 all)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 hair colors to choose from 15 unique hairstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyebrows, lashes, eyes, mouth, and skin colors \u2013 we have you covered!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 craftable crops with 7 colors to mix in your Sawing Machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 hours of fashion-filled farming and storytelling!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/d22df961d62804f9720ce92bf6bca1b7.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/d22df961d62804f9720ce92bf6bca1b7.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Loom Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/782c216bc8653956dc3793463bad8891382d6834.jpg"},{"name":"Colorful Mastermind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/0e3c4ba0b53b4ce18533f2b03c4cf7a9a4314a01.jpg"},{"name":"Fashion Designer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/c90efdd7a3581161c5ecbbbf1fcc0aab72b0c0a6.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/149eb6240fe2c8369b1fbe68e6047b4c211fd058.jpg"},{"name":"Harvester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/a02cbb60f1a1d78e9c599fe7a7973b728c3f2af1.jpg"},{"name":"Good Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/0a39704632b6c599836b297da0dfe9cd6be252e8.jpg"},{"name":"Jouicy Sprouts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/37aebb523f0c63a0066408b4071d63e39b8569ca.jpg"},{"name":"Orders Served","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/f013d808eeec9d639d6839de82cca44785484f9a.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle Eye to Details","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/68e38b3c9db277aa01ccafb4c7fba1e578027da2.jpg"},{"name":"Top Seller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3290600/23d71a51ae2e914d7446f988244bcd75126d2412.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3290600?t=1754306561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/c3125d303188bfa3871b4df2da15a90867f28672/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754306561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/50376d15a58970a72338236688ac6f76570d5127/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754306561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/50376d15a58970a72338236688ac6f76570d5127/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754306561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3608310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From planting seeds to sewing stylish outfits, every day is a mix of creativity and farming fun. Run your atelier, make unique outfits using sewing patterns, and dress up customers based on their requests. Customize your character, try out different styles, and bring your fashion dreams to life. It\u2019s time to grow your way to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/2a176174b7fa045b95d253e3f3321b7a.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/2a176174b7fa045b95d253e3f3321b7a.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/7ca9620fe3ffbe95eac59e2f600f711a.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend\u2019s unexpected offer of a new life in Cottonville might be just what you need. Far from the noise of Friglight, a small family sewing shop is waiting for you in this peaceful town. Cottonville offers a cozy escape where you can start fresh and build your career, one stitch at a time, while letting the drama of the big city fade away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/7ed2d1717300606693bb6f31a7714486.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/7ed2d1717300606693bb6f31a7714486.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/07679956f2f879f3d4ca99d75a1756fd.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character truly yours! Choose hairstyles, eyes, skin, and more alongside the outfits that match your style. As you progress, unlock new fashion items and expand your wardrobe to reflect your journey in Cottonville.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/6ea21c0ae87282a9a37a941a88663e21.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/6ea21c0ae87282a9a37a941a88663e21.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/bb9336189bf72430b181be69c13bfe33.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re growing crops or crafting trendy outfits, Cottonville combines the simple joys of farm life with the excitement of fashion design. You\u2019ll learn everything from fabric-making to fashion styling \u2013 right from the farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/a8dd650210b9df93011a77bf841734ef.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/a8dd650210b9df93011a77bf841734ef.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/01edae0915475a4040bf5662cfae1368.avif?t=1754306561\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and harvest essential crops like <strong>cotton, linen, and bamboo</strong>, and gather flowers for natural dyes to produce fabrics \u2013 all available in <strong>seven different colors</strong>. Buy new sewing patterns to expand your dress-up options and make even more fashionable clothes. Your farm provides everything needed to craft stylish outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/f4762298901784f09980bff9a6951e20.poster.avif?t=1754306561\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290600/extras/f4762298901784f09980bff9a6951e20.webm?t=1754306561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your atelier is the heart of Cottonville\u2019s fashion world! With <strong>over 60 clothing designs</strong> and multiple color variations, you can sew, dye, and customize garments using a set collection of sewing patterns to match your customers' needs. Listen to their requests, mix and match fabrics, and create outfits that suit their personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.